1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,864
And the numbers, which are asked every year.

2
00:00:02,864 --> 00:00:05,221
Diameter two nanometres.

3
00:00:05,221 --> 00:00:16,145
One full turn, the pitch, three point four nanometres, containing ten base pairs, so neighbouring base pairs are zero point three four nanometres apart.

4
00:00:16,145 --> 00:00:20,911
The coiling also leaves a wide major groove and a narrow minor groove.

